        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
            左边看"安全边界有没有被守住"，右边看"钱是不是花在了便宜的时候"
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
